@startuml SpeakSteps_Therapist_Sequence
!theme plain
title SpeakSteps - Therapist Management & Review Sequence Diagram

participant Therapist as therapist
participant "Therapist Portal\n(Web)" as portal
participant "Firebase\nAuth" as auth
participant "Backend API" as api
participant "Cueing\nEngine" as cueing
participant "ML\nPredictor" as ml
participant "Firestore\nDB" as db

therapist -> portal: 1. Sign In
portal -> auth: 2. Authenticate
auth -> db: 3. Verify User (role=therapist)
db --> auth: 4. User Valid
auth --> portal: 5. Auth Token
portal --> therapist: 6. Login Success

therapist -> portal: 7. Select Patient
portal -> db: 8. Query Patient Profile & Progress
db --> portal: 9. Return Patient Data

therapist -> portal: 10. Assign/Adjust Modules
portal -> api: 11. Upsert Assignment
api -> db: 12. Save Assignment
db --> api: 13. Saved
api --> portal: 14. Confirm Assignment

therapist -> portal: 15. Request Progress & Analytics
portal -> api: 16. Query ExerciseSessions
api -> db: 17. Fetch Session Data
db --> api: 18. Return Raw Session Data

api -> api: 19. Aggregate Stats\n(accuracy, time, cues used,\ntrends, charts)
api --> portal: 20. Return Aggregated Stats\n& Summaries

portal --> therapist: 21. Render Analytics\n& Progress Charts

portal --> therapist: 21. Render Analytics\n& Progress Charts

therapist -> portal: 22. Review Cue Decisions
portal -> api: 23. Get Cue Audit Trail
api -> db: 24. Query Cue/Response History
db --> api: 25. History
api --> portal: 26. Return Audit

therapist -> portal: 27. Update Cue Parameters\n(rules thresholds)
portal -> api: 28. Save Cue Config
api -> db: 29. Persist Config
db --> api: 30. Saved
api --> cueing: 31. Reload Config

therapist -> portal: 32. Export/Share Patient Report
portal -> api: 33. Generate Report
api -> db: 34. Gather Data
db --> api: 35. Data Ready
api --> portal: 36. Report Link/PDF

opt Realtime monitoring
  db --> portal: Snapshot Update\n(session progress, cues used)
end

@enduml
